# Sample 8x8 Breakthrough game (illustrative, not a master game).
# Move tokens are 4 chars: from-square immediately followed by to-square,
# e.g. b2b3 or e5d4 (captures look the same — no separator).
# Comments start with '#'. Move numbers and dots are ignored.

 1. b2b3   g7g6
 2. c2c3   f7f6
 3. d2d3   e7e6
 4. b3c4   f6e5
 5. d3d4   e5d4
 6. c3d4   g6f5
 7. d4d5   f5e4
